{"time": "20261117T171806Z", "think": "Final notes.", "command": "answer I work for the Toh-Reel-Ka as a Reel-Ka under Never-Writes-Twice. I now carry two Seal-Stones of the Kings (Blackrose and Gemin), plus about 350 gold, Eye-Setting, Keystone, 3 paralysis poison, sap jar, rapier, Reelka armour and Warden Vault Key. At Gemin I killed the Unbound rearguard, the restless dead and the warden. The tablet says the Eye, lifted, parts every tree from every other; used where it sits, it strengthens them. One stone remains in the deepest hall of Vorannuhl (boat near Noota Nara). All three go into the gate at the drowned Teku-Sul Spire off Lilmoth. Open questions: why the Unbound seal trees, what moans in the Fort Chalkmoth cellar and where its key is, how Nesh-Deeka knows about the Unbound. Rival: the Collector, Ennodius Vanin.", "result": "Thank you. Your notes are kept; the game is over. You can stop now.", "summary": {"stage": 91, "at": "gemin", "items": {"item.lockpick": 2, "thing.mn.unbound-note": 1, "item.mn05.voh-vastei-armour": 1, "thing.mn.eye-setting": 1, "thing.mn.keystone": 1, "thing.mn.grave-stake": 1, "thing.mn.paralysis-poison": 3, "thing.mn.bronze-disc": 1, "thing.mn.parchment-map": 1, "thing.mn10.rapier": 1, "thing.mn12.sap-jar": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-cuirass": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-helm": 1, "thing.mn.seal-stone-thief": 1, "thing.mn.seal-stone-vault": 1}, "gold": 1650, "flags": {"flag.mn03.truth": true, "flag.mn06.note-read": true, "flag.mn06.done": true, "flag.main.seal-question": true, "flag.main.rank-toh-wo": true, "flag.mn11.rubbing-read": true, "flag.mn11.done": true, "flag.mn12.trapdoor": true, "flag.mn12.door-tried": true, "flag.mn12.cellar-seen": true, "flag.mn13.archwarden-beds": true, "flag.mn13.done": true, "flag.mn14.inside-unseen": true}, "dead": ["npc.mn.hums-the-long-note", "npc.mn15.unbound-rearguard", "npc.mn15.vault-dead", "npc.mn15.wraith"], "heard": ["topic.mn01-name", "topic.mn01-trade-warrior", "topic.mn01-dralin-free", "topic.mn02-g